.TH "bead recurrence show" 1  "bead recurrence show " 
.SH NAME
bead recurrence show \- Show a recurrence template
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead recurrence show\fR <\fB\-\-id\fR> [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display detailed information about a specific recurrence template including
its configuration and materialization history.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR=\fIID\fR
Template ID
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
